  "gaps": [
    "breed: remove an inventory line or a perk line (gen breed set has set and add, no delete): add a `del:` map to gen breed (patch-entity applyEdit already has op del)",
    "breed: perk keys are quoted (\"health\"); gen breed set path matching on quoted names is untested [I]: a gen breed `perks: {health: 150%}` map that writes {\"kind\" value} lines and refuses a level the ability does not declare (GPL-13)",
    "breed: inventory as a whole list (replace all lines, order, in_hands index follow): gen breed `inventory: [\"mp40 filled\", \"bandage 3\"]` + `in_hands: mp40`",
    "card: vanilla soldier declarations are macro calls, so gen breed decl:cp/score/cw/tags finds no {cp} field to set (GEN_FIELD_UNKNOWN) [I]: gen breed `decl` writes an expanded {\"mp/<army>/<name>\" {tags}{cp}{score}{basic}{breed}{cw}} block instead of the macro copy",
    "look: new humanskin from a copy (folder copy, def/mdl/mtl renamed, textures swapped): gen op `skin` {like, name, textures:{diffuse,bump,specular}} on top of /art/copy",
    "look: humanskin.def tag, rimlight, mtl color/blend/tile have no writer: covered by the same gen `skin` op (set map on def and mtl)",
    "face: interface/scene/squad/<icon>.tga squad bar icon has no writer (/art/icon-png writes unit_icon and unit_icon_small only): add kind 'squadbar' to /art/icon-png",
    "text: names/<nationality>/first|last lists (new nationality) have no writer: gen text can add keys, but a new nationality needs a `names` op that writes both lists",
    "veterancy: inline thresholds or a new veterancy macro: gen breed `veterancy_table: [4,8,24,48,80]` writing an inline {veterancy} block",
    "shared: human.ext vitality, box, armor holders, foot speeds, ability levels and veterancy.set ranks have no writer and change every soldier: gen set op on properties/human.ext and set/ability (`set` op with a file path), recipe should list them under kept by default",
    "squads: which squads use the soldier is only written from the squad side (gen squad members); the soldier recipe needs a branch to the squad recipe, no new op"
  ]
}
